Revision history for PETSGI

0.01  2026-08-30
      - initial PETSGI protocol and application framework prototype
      - added CGI::Tiny adapter and Dispatch::Fu operation routing
      - added safe petdisk.php-compatible filesystem application
      - added PRG/SEQ/D64 directory, ranged read, PUT, block update, and TIME support
      - added filesystem-backed materialization for dynamic CGI resources
      - added initial 40-column PET target and tokenized BASIC PRG generator
      - added optional SQLite identity/session state store
      - added PETdisk MAX protocol mock, unit tests, and GitHub Actions CI
      - added PETSGI::Context as the application-facing runtime boundary
      - added semantic view() and action() application APIs
      - added initial PETSGI::UI::Screen intermediate representation for 40-column UX
      - documented the executable-view/reactive-resource full-stack application model
      - added tests for semantic UI, executable views, dynamic SEQ resources, and actions
